---
// src/components/Values.astro
---
<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-6">A Unique Community Approach</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                At Another Step, there is no "center" or "program site." We provide all-day supports utilizing 
                generic community resources like college facilities, libraries, gyms, and local businesses.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                Skill development occurs at the time and place the skill would normally be used, ensuring 
                participants are full, valued members of their community.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border-l-8 border-yellow-400">
            <blockquote class="text-xl italic text-gray-600">
                "The best opportunities for people with developmental disabilities to fulfill their potential... 
                occur naturally in their communities and neighborhoods."
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>